{"ref":"BDB, שָׂרָה³","hw":"שָׂרָה³","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. princess, noble lady</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרָ֫תִי</span> (Ges<sup>§ 90 l</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:1\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.1\">La 1:1</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.3\">1 K 11:3</a>, cstr. id. <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:18\" href=\"/Esther.1.18\">Est 1:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרוֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:29\" href=\"/Judges.5.29\">Ju 5:29</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">תֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.23\">Is 49:23</a>;—<em>princesses</em> attending Sisera’s mother <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:29\" href=\"/Judges.5.29\">Ju 5:29</a>; of Sol.’s wives <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.3\">1 K 11:3</a>, other queens <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.23\">Is 49:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלָכִים</span>); wives of nobles <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:18\" href=\"/Esther.1.18\">Est 1:18</a>; fig. of Jerus. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:1\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.1\">La 1:1</a>.","next":"BDB, שָׂרָה⁴","prev":"BDB, שָׂרַר"}